# Trivy ignore list
#
# These CVEs live in tooling bundled INSIDE the official Node.js/Nginx base
# images (e.g. npm's own vendored node_modules, or base-OS packages) — not in
# this application's code or its runtime dependencies. A fixed version exists
# upstream, but the official base image tag hasn't picked it up yet. There is
# no action the app Dockerfiles can take beyond waiting for the next base
# image release, so they are suppressed here rather than permanently blocking
# the pipeline.
#
# Review periodically and remove entries once the base images are rebuilt
# with the fix, or once we move to a slimmer runtime (e.g. distroless) that
# doesn't bundle npm.
#
# Last reviewed: 2026-10-15

